[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=ReliefCapture
GenericName=Screenshot and Annotation
GenericName[zh_CN]=截图与标注
Comment=Capture, annotate and save screenshots
Comment[zh_CN]=截取屏幕、窗口或区域，添加标注并保存 PNG
